{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"一、二年。春王二月，季孫斯、叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌帥師伐邾婁，取漷東田及沂西田。癸巳，叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌及邾婁子盟于句繹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"二、夏四月丙子，衞侯元卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"三、滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"四、晉趙鞅帥師納衞世子蒯聵于戚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"戚者何？衞之邑也。曷為不言入于衞？父有子，子不得有父也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"五、秋八月甲戌，晉趙鞅帥師及鄭軒達帥師戰于栗，鄭師敗績。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"六、冬十月，葬衞靈公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_229_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_229","textTraditional":"七、十有一月，蔡遷于州來。蔡殺其大夫公子駟。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}